{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>יפיחו</b> — They will stir up snares, that is, HaShem will set snares to entrap them because of scoffers." "<b>וחכמים</b> — With their wisdom they will turn away, even HaShem, and they will escape the snares."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {0 "Resolved השם as HaShem per divine-name rules."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:21.020118348Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}